We couldn't fit in this video.

36:09.180 --> 36:13.180
And it walks you through thought exercises to help you discover SaaS opportunities hiding

36:13.180 --> 36:14.300
at your work day.

36:14.300 --> 36:17.340
You can get your free copy at robwalling.com slash ideas.

36:17.340 --> 36:19.060
I hope you find it helpful.

36:19.060 --> 36:22.180
Once you've found your SaaS idea, the next step is validation.

36:22.180 --> 36:25.340
And that's exactly what I cover in this next video.

